> 💬 **Low volume baseline** ({{ jobs }} job(s) this week vs {{ avg_jobs | round(1) }} on average): variations are not significant.
{% else %}
> 💬 Volume is **{{ 'stable' if vol | abs < 15 else ('up ' ~ (vol | round(0) | int) ~ '%' if vol > 0 else 'down ' ~ (vol | abs | round(0) | int) ~ '%') }}**
> vs the 12-week average ({{ jobs }} vs {{ avg_jobs | round(0) | int }} jobs).
{% endif %}
